        "one_column_UfpW9X": {
          "type": "one_column",
          "settings": {
            "tab_heading": "Size & Fit",
            "heading_column_1": "Size & Fit",
            "heading_font_class_column_1": "fs-heading-4-base",
            "heading_tag_column_1": "h2",
            "text_column_1": "",
            "page_for_content_column_1": "size-guide",
            "custom_liquid_column_1": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  \n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n            margin: 20px;\n        }\n        .container {\n            padding: 20px;\n            border: 1px solid #ccc;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n        }\n        h2 {\n            font-size: 14px;\n        }\n        input {\n            width: 100%;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n            padding: 10px;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            border: 1px solid #ccc;\n        }\n        button.btn--calculate {\n            padding: 10px;\n            width: 100%;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            background-color: black;\n            color: white;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;\n        }\n        button.btn--calculate:hover {\n            background-color: white;\n            color: black;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <h2>A2 Bikes Size Calculator</h2>\n        <label for=\"heightFeet\">Height (Feet):</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"heightFeet\" placeholder=\"Feet\" min=\"0\">\n        \n        <label for=\"heightInches\">Height (Inches):</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"heightInches\" placeholder=\"Inches\" min=\"0\">\n        \n        <label for=\"inseam\">Inseam (Inches):</label>\n        <input type=\"number\" id=\"inseam\" placeholder=\"Inseam\" min=\"0\">\n\n        <button class=\"btn--calculate\" onclick=\"calculateSize()\">Calculate Size</button>\n        <div id=\"result\" style=\"margin-top: 20px;\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        function calculateSize() {\n            const heightFeet = parseInt(document.getElementById('heightFeet').value);\n            const heightInches = parseInt(document.getElementById('heightInches').value);\n            const inseam = parseInt(document.getElementById('inseam').value);\n\n            if (isNaN(heightFeet) || isNaN(heightInches) || isNaN(inseam)) {\n                document.getElementById('result').innerText = 'Please enter valid numbers.';\n                return;\n            }\n\n            const totalHeightInInches = (heightFeet * 12) + heightInches;\n\n            let size;\n            if (totalHeightInInches >= 63 && totalHeightInInches <= 66) { // 5'3\" to 5'6\"\n                size = 'Size Small';\n            } else if (totalHeightInInches >= 67 && totalHeightInInches <= 70) { // 5'7\" to 5'10\"\n                size = 'Size Medium';\n            } else if (totalHeightInInches >= 71 && totalHeightInInches <= 73) { // 5'11\" to 6'1\"\n                size = 'Size Large';\n            } else if (totalHeightInInches >= 74 && totalHeightInInches <= 76) { // 6'1\" to 6'4\"\n                size = 'Size XL';\n            } else {\n                size = 'Height not in size range.';\n            }\n\n            document.getElementById('result').innerText = `Your suggested bike size is: ${size}`;\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
            "text_font_class_column_1": "fs-body-100",
            "content_width": "custom",
            "text_max_width": 800,
            "image_width_column_1": 100,
            "image_position_column_1": "above_text"
          }
        },
        "one_column_acnHT7": {
          "type": "one_column",
          "settings": {
            "tab_heading": "Lifetime Warranty",
            "heading_column_1": "SP Lifetime Warranty",
            "heading_font_class_column_1": "fs-heading-4-base",
            "heading_tag_column_1": "h2",
            "text_column_1": "<p>When you ride an A2, you can ride with confidence. That's because your SP is backed by our lifetime warranty. From your first race to your biggest achievement, we stand behind every SP frame, for life. <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Read more here.</span></p>",
            "page_for_content_column_1": "",
            "custom_liquid_column_1": "",
            "text_font_class_column_1": "fs-body-100",
            "content_width": "custom",
            "text_max_width": 800,
            "image_width_column_1": 100,
            "image_position_column_1": "above_text"
          }
        },
        "one_column_iJUxAt": {
          "type": "one_column",
          "settings": {
            "tab_heading": "Crash Replacement Policy",
            "heading_column_1": "Crash Replacement Policy",
            "heading_font_class_column_1": "fs-heading-4-base",
            "heading_tag_column_1": "h2",
            "text_column_1": "<p>We understand that crashes happen, and it can already be a lot as it is. That is why we create the <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">A2 Crash Replacement Policy</span>, which states any SP frame directly purchased from A2, in the event of a crash, will be fully replaced by us, no additional cost. </p>",
            "page_for_content_column_1": "",
            "custom_liquid_column_1": "",
            "text_font_class_column_1": "fs-body-100",
            "content_width": "custom",
            "text_max_width": 800,
            "image_width_column_1": 100,
            "image_position_column_1": "above_text"
          }
        },
        "two_column_tab_QmTHWe": {
          "type": "two_column_tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab_heading": "Shipping & Returns",
            "content_vertical_alignment": "top",
            "column_spacing": 48,
            "heading_column_1": "Standard shipping",
            "heading_font_class_column_1": "fs-heading-4-base",
            "heading_tag_column_1": "h3",
            "text_column_1": "<p>Standard ground shipping usually takes between 3 and 5 business days and is $99. <br/></p>",
            "page_for_content_column_1": "",
            "custom_liquid_column_1": "",
            "text_font_class_column_1": "fs-body-100",
            "image_width_column_1": 100,
            "image_position_column_1": "above_text",
            "heading_column_2": "Free Easy Returns",
            "heading_font_class_column_2": "fs-heading-4-base",
            "heading_tag_column_2": "h3",
            "text_column_2": "<p>Buying a bike shouldn't be a stressful experience. That's why we work with you during the purchasing process to ensure you get the perfect bike to fit your needs. If you need to exchange or return your bike, contact our customer service team within 30 days of purchase if you need to exchange your bike. A2 is happy to provide <strong>free size exchanges on all bikes that we produce.</strong></p>",
            "page_for_content_column_2": "",
            "custom_liquid_column_2": "",
            "text_font_class_column_2": "fs-body-100",
            "image_width_column_2": 100,
            "image_position_column_2": "above_text"
          }
        }
      },
