    "gallery_carousel_bVqVQi": {
      "type": "gallery-carousel",
      "blocks": {
        "image_hPGenN": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/17_09fbcb3a-017c-4bcc-abd1-74f7b756c7d5.png",
            "focal_point": "image_presentation",
            "title": "Rogue 105",
            "text": "<p>Simple, reliable, and built for exploration. The Rogue 105 is our most popular all-road build, equipped with Shimano’s trusted 105 groupset. Perfect for riders seeking dependability on climbs, descents, and gravel stretches while keeping adventure within reach.</p>"
          }
        },
        "image_3faB7X": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/18.png",
            "focal_point": "image_presentation",
            "title": "Rogue Apex AXS 1x",
            "text": "<p>Modern, wireless, and built for adventure. The Rogue Apex AXS 1x features SRAM’s intuitive wireless shifting, giving you smooth, precise gear changes with just the tap of a button. With a wide-range cassette and simplified 1x setup, it’s perfect for riders who want performance and versatility on every road, paved or unpaved.</p>"
          }
        },
        "image_PY8aCx": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/19.png",
            "focal_point": "image_presentation",
            "title": "Rogue Rival AXS",
            "text": "<p>A step up from Apex, the Rogue Rival AXS delivers precise electronic shifting from SRAM. With a streamlined 2x drivetrain and wide gear range, it’s built to handle long climbs, fast descents, and everything in between, making every ride smoother and more efficient.</p>"
          }
        },
        "image_UXGqqi": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/20.png",
            "focal_point": "image_presentation",
            "title": "Rogue Force AXS",
            "text": "<p>Many riders choose the Rogue Force AXS for its high-end performance without the premium price tag of Red. This build strikes the perfect balance between efficiency and refinement, making it a top choice for cyclists who want to climb stronger, descend faster, and take on long rides with confidence.</p>"
          }
        },
        "image_rgdqxq": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/21_3b639101-3f1b-4c7e-a23f-f263a7f7fec3.png",
            "focal_point": "image_presentation",
            "title": "Rogue Red AXS",
            "text": "<p>The Rogue Red AXS represents the peak of all-road performance. Outfitted with SRAM’s lightest and most precise Red AXS groupset and paired with Zipp 353 NSW carbon wheels, this build is for riders chasing the ultimate in speed, responsiveness, and climbing efficiency. Designed for those who demand nothing less than excellence on every ride.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
